abstract: "Aggregate experiment evidence, measurement methods, public devnet identifiers, measured artifact hashes, source-derived implementation pseudocode, and synthetic offline checks for Moving Civic Identity Verification to the Edge: A Privacy-Preserving Architecture for One-Person-One-Participation Digital Polling. The package supports inspection with stated limits; it does not reproduce the experiments or provide an independent security audit."
